# Workspace state is per-machine and stays out, but not wholesale: the SwiftPM
# resolution lives inside the project's workspace, and Package.resolved names
# the exact commit of every dependency. A dependency set that exists only on one
# machine is worthless to every other machine, so it is tracked.
